# LaTeX build artifacts
# Based on the standard GitHub TeX.gitignore. The compiled
# manuscript/main.pdf is committed deliberately and stays tracked.

## Core latex/pdflatex auxiliary files
*.aux
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.fls
*.out
*.toc
*.fmt
*.fot
*.cb
*.cb2
.*.lb

## Intermediate documents
*.dvi
*.xdv
*-converted-to.*

## Bibliography auxiliary files (bibtex/biblatex/biber)
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*-blx.aux
*-blx.bib
*.run.xml

## Build tool auxiliary files
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex
*.synctex(busy)
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex.gz(busy)
*.pdfsync

## Auxiliary and intermediate files from other packages
# algorithms
*.alg
*.loa
# hyperref
*.brf
# listings
*.lol
# makeidx
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
# glossaries
*.acn
*.acr
*.glg
*.glo
*.gls
*.glsdefs
# todonotes
*.tdo
# xindy
*.xdy

## Editor / OS clutter
*.bak
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
